   456	## 11. Uniform explicit right sides: a rational GS basis for every finite type
   457	
   458	This continuation replaces the normal-form oracle in Theorem B's right sides by a finite,
   459	explicit output table. Its result is a GS basis, **not in general a reduced GS basis**.
   460	The book asks for a GS basis; the stronger reduced-basis problem is distinguished below.
